1. Added the import for JotaiProvider from 'jotai'
2. Wrapped the ConnectedCalendarItem component with JotaiProvider

This should resolve the error related to the missing jotai dependency. If you encounter any other errors after this fix, please let me know and I'll help resolve those as well.

